# Rhythm Culture supports alternative housing - Earthships visits Sunshine Coast libraries.

![House](http://www.sunshinecoast.qld.gov.au/library/images/page_images/discover_earthships_pg.jpg) Imagine living off the grid where houses are cheap to build, can help provide food for the family and are self-heated or cooled all year round. Ryan Mayne will be visiting libraries around the Sunshine Coast explaining the basic Earthship design principals. Find out what is happening around the world with the construction of ecofriendly, sustainable housing. Get tips on making your own home more environmentally friendly and cheaper to live in. For more information see [here.](http://library.sunshinecoast.qld.gov.au/sitePage.cfm?code=earthships "Sunshine Coast Libraries presents Earthships")

